to what I've called the source code of scouting, the DNA,

113
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:07,560
the thing that makes scouting what it is,

114
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:14,360
The focus that we should all know by heart and that we should be paying attention to.

115
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:16,720
If we could come up with that right

116
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:22,600
And everyone agreed that this is where we're headed,

117
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:23,760
This is our aim,

118
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:25,560
This is what we do,

119
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:29,320
Then we'd be better able to serve the scouts that we serve, correct?

